### 2. Master Post-Quantum Key (Modern Channel • NIST FIPS 203 ML-KEM / pqpg)

Used for quantum-resistant lattice encapsulation (immune to Harvest Now, Decrypt Later attacks).

=> /nymserver-pq-pubkey.asc Download nymserver-pq-pubkey.asc (SHA256: 277df4d834cb0cbd6d4e1d3e4be3b50beb10d6b59059240a4b11c225108d89a3)
=> /nymserver-pq-pubkey.bin Download Raw Binary Key (nymserver-pq-pubkey.bin - 1184 bytes)
=> /bin/pqpg-linux-amd64 Download Standalone CLI Client pqpg

Text Format: ASCII Armor (Header: -----BEGIN PQPG PUBLIC KEY-----)
Hybrid Suite: NIST FIPS 203 ML-KEM-768 + X25519 (DH) + Ed25519 (Signatures)
